OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 5, will need to learn to walk
OL,4,Aagain after surgery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA five-year-old boy hopes to show
OL,7,Fothers that "even the biggest journeys
OL,8,Fbegin with one small step" as he learns
OL,9,Fto walk again after major foot surgery.
OL,11,FKai, from Walton, Liverpool, was born
OL,12,Fwith a rare condition affecting his
OL,13,Fjoints and muscles called
OL,14,Farthrogryposis and needed surgery on
OL,15,Fhis feet at just one month old.
OL,17,FHe recently needed another operation
OL,18,Fafter his feet started to relapse, and
OL,19,Fnow he faces a long road to recovery.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
