OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 5, will need to learn to walk
OL,4,Aagain after surgery
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut his mother Talia said her son had
OL,7,Fset himself the goal of walking 41
OL,8,Fmiles (65km) on his own once he has
OL,9,Frecovered.
